  <name>RestrictTransactionsWithImportedGoodsWithoutCCDNumbers</name>
  <synonym>
    <key>en</key>
    <value>Prohibit registration of operations with imported goods without CCD numbers</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>fa</key>
    <value>منع ثبت عملیات با کالای وارداتی بدون شماره‌های CCD</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>it</key>
    <value>Vietare la registrazione delle transazioni di importazione senza numeri della Dichiarazione doganale</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>pl</key>
    <value>Zabroń rejestracji operacji z towarami importowymi bez numerów ładunkowych deklaracji celnych</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>ru</key>
    <value>Запретить оформление операций с импортными товарами без номеров ГТД</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>tr</key>
    <value>GKB numarası olmayan ithal ürünlerle yapılan işlemleri yasakla</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>vi</key>
    <value>Cấm tạo các giao dịch với hàng hóa nhập khẩu mà không có số tờ khai hải quan</value>
  </synonym>
  <location>Constant.RestrictTransactionsWithImportedGoodsWithoutCCDNumbers</location>
  <privilegedGetMode>true</privilegedGetMode>
</mdclass:FunctionalOption>
